<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on CS Holding.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on CS Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued a total of 2.5 million American-style call warrants, on CS Holding, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>Two warrants control one shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    130.00 SFR		PREMIUM	9.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.10 SFR		  GEARING	12.50 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.SEP.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	02.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  127.75 SFR</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
